*
!Dockerfile
!tools
!tools/ckzg-ffi
!tools/ckzg-ffi/shim.c
!tools/bls-ffi
!tools/bls-ffi/shim.c
!tools/rocksdb
!tools/rocksdb/rocksdb-11.1.2.tar.gz
# Dockerfile.runtime compiles the client INTO the image instead of bind-mounting
# the workspace the way the test image does, so it needs the system definition
# and the source tree in the context. ./Dockerfile copies neither, so its layer
# cache is unaffected -- only the context upload grows, by ~3.5 MB.
!Dockerfile.runtime
!ethereum-lisp.asd
!src
!src/**
